 "purpose": "Normal/height and AO/roughness for the live-lit 3D face, baked at the approved decal carve geometry: the glyph area is displaced inward through a 0.3 mm Bezier transition so the wall is inside the painted silhouette (the decals' bright rim and dark inner shadow). The committed relief albedo is reused because the paint colour and mask do not depend on the carve geometry.",
